  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-101\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 101</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Les articles 73, 74, 75,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et 3°,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">76, 80 à 85, 87, 88,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">89,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"f\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et</span></li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"g\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n          </ol>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"d\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et</span></li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"e\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n          </ol>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et 6°,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">90, 91,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et 2°,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">95 à 100 entrent en vigueur à partir de l'exercice d'imposition 1993.</p>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">L'article 75,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, entre en vigueur à partir de l'exercice d'imposition 1993, à l'exception de l'article 52,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"9°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">du Code des impôts sur les revenus 1992, dans la mesure où il est remplacé par l'article 145.1.,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, du même Code, qui entre en vigueur à partir de l'exercice d'imposition 1994.</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">L'article 86 entre en vigueur à partir de l'exercice d'imposition 1993, à l'exception des articles 145.1.,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et 145.2. dans la mesure où il concerne l'article 145.1.,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">, et 145.3. du Code des impôts sur les revenus 1992, insérés par ledit article 86, qui entrent en vigueur à partir de l'exercice d'imposition 1994.</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Les articles 77, 78, 79, 88,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">89,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"d\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et</span></li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"e\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n          </ol>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et</span></li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"c\"><span class=\"provision-text\">,</span></li>\n          </ol>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et 5°,</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">entrent en vigueur à partir de l'exercice d'imposition 1994.</p>\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">Les articles 91,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">et 92 à 94 entrent en vigueur le 1er janvier 1993.</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
